#: docs/status/roadmap.md:9
msgid "当前迭代与进入条件"
msgstr "Current iterations and entry conditions"

#: docs/status/roadmap.md:11
msgid ""
"本轮集中打磨 F4，不扩展其他生产系列。优先完成现有 F407 行为保全、精确型号事实、 共享 IP 归并和失效工具清理；然后逐模式复用官方 "
"HAL／LL，收敛生成行为与 Host 工具。"
msgstr ""
"This iteration focuses on F4 rather than expanding other production series. "
"First preserve existing F407 behavior, exact-part facts, shared IP "
"consolidation and obsolete-tool cleanup. Then reuse official HAL/LL mode by "
"mode and consolidate generated behavior and host tooling."

#: docs/status/roadmap.md:14
msgid "其他 F4 型号需要独立事实和差异验证；系列目录、官方宏或代表器件通过不构成整个 系列完成。实板接入后再执行真实 HIL，当前状态保持未执行。"
msgstr ""
"Other F4 parts need independent facts and difference validation. A series "
"directory, official macro or passed representative device does not complete "
"an entire series. Execute real HIL after connecting boards; current state "
"remains unexecuted."

#: docs/status/roadmap.md:17
msgid ""
"后续退出见[迭代边界](../delivery/next-iterations.md)。新行为执行真实 RED→GREEN， C 合同使用 "
"GoogleTest／GoogleMock，普通提交保留完整门禁和高风险独立审查。旧专项 "
"[原记录](ledgers.md)保留身份，不重新计算为本轮完成率。"
msgstr ""
"See [iteration boundaries](../delivery/next-iterations.md) for future exits. "
"New behavior follows actual RED→GREEN; C contracts use GoogleTest/GoogleMock."
" Ordinary commits retain full gates and independent review for high-risk "
"changes. Earlier [original records](ledgers.md) keep their identities and are"
" not recalculated into this iteration's completion percentage."
